# Feature map

One row per sliceable domain. `feature_id` equals endpoint-map `feature_ids[]` entries.
First `feature_ids` value on an endpoint owns that row.
Skill path is created when that slice starts (slice-workflow step 1), except `core-status` which already exists.
Status is `inventoried` until a slice moves it. Features: 32. Endpoints: 548. `parity: tested`: 232.

Locked implementation: `files-sharing-public-dav` on `cursor/files-sharing-public-dav-e1af` from shareinfo harvest `527bd5c`. Two endpoints tested: dav.Public#tree and dav.Public#legacy-webdav.

Recommended first slice: **core-status** (`/status.php` + OCS capabilities) then **core-login** (session/login/CSRF).

